# Accepted trivy findings, each with its reason and an expiry date.
# ci/validate.sh fails if any of them is no longer reported, so an exception
# cannot outlive its cause.

# GCP-0059, private nodes. The nodes download the vLLM image and the model
# weights from the internet; private nodes need Cloud NAT, to be added and
# tested with the next live run (README, Limits).
GCP-0059 exp:2027-03-31

# GCP-0011, project-wide service-account roles for the apply identity
# (bootstrap/ci-identity/apply.tf). terraform/ creates service accounts and
# binds them, so the apply identity holds serviceAccountUser and, the same
# risk in practice, serviceAccountAdmin on the project: it could act as any
# service account in it. Mitigated by a keyless identity usable only from the
# terraform-apply environment (required reviewer, main only). Fix: create with
# serviceAccountCreator, grant user/admin only on the accounts terraform/
# creates; proved by the first apply from CI.
GCP-0011 exp:2027-03-31
